SUMMARY: Music in St. James Park -- 2026 Summer Season
DESCRIPTION:An evening of folk rock featuring Misty Blue.\n\nHitting the 
 ground running as an acoustic duo\, Misty Blue has quickly evolved into a
  4-piece rock band making a mark in Toronto's emerging music scene.\n\nMu
 sic in St. James Park is a summer series of concerts on Thursday nights i
 n June\, July and August presented by the Old Town Toronto BIA.\n\nFree\n
 \n
