SUMMARY: Music in Court House Square Park
DESCRIPTION:Featuring Julia Simone\n\nJulia Simone is a multi-talented Si
 nger\, Songwriter\, and Recovery Practitioner\, whose music and work expl
 ores what it means to be human. Largely influenced by her journey healing
  from addiction & trauma\, her time living in nature and learning from in
 digenous elders of the Sierra Nevada\, Julia’s art & programs explore how
  to heal. Her soulful lyrics and melodies cut through layered live instru
 ments and rhythms in a way that draws us into her lived experiences.\n\nW
 ebsite: Juliasimone.ca http://juliasimone.ca/\n\n\nThis performance is on
 e of four musical presentations in Court House Square Park being presente
 d each Wednesday in July by the Old Town Toronto BIA.\n\nFree
