SUMMARY: Music in Court House Square Park
DESCRIPTION:Featuring J.E. Lopez\n\nJ.E. Lopez is a Filipino-Canadian gui
 tarist\, vocalist\, and songwriter based in Toronto\, whose music grounds
  itself in the deep tradition of the blues while he carves out his own co
 ntribution to its next chapter. Blending the visceral force of classic bl
 ues with a deeply expressive musical voice\, his songs move between fiery
  guitar-driven moments and intimate\, reflective spaces.\n\nWebsite: jelo
 pezmusic.com http://jelopezmusic.com\n\nThis performance is one of four m
 usical presentations in Court House Square Park being presented each Wedn
 esday in July by the Old Town Toronto BIA.\n\nFree
